into her broad chest Maria managed to slip her hand between the strap and her neck giving herself a brief reprieve and a desperately needed inhale of air She twisted herself around until she was facing her master tucker Using her free hand. She grasped the balaclava that covered Tanya's face and pulled it away In the heat of the life and death battle Tanya and Maria laid eyes on each other That was the first time they had met Maria screamed out her daughter's name several times for help In a morbid twist Laura had woken to the sound of her mother's screaming

